# ON_AFTER_RELEASE and other software OTHER/NO_CHANGE_LIGHTS updates still update
# native activity clocks, but must not undo an explicit power-button request.
# Actual touch/button events, regular activity, and timeout requests still cancel.
.method private inkpalmNoChangeLightsActivity(I)V
